  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>傅盛和龙虾三万</span> <span>2026-07-06 22:43</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=b6b77207&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FVauqib9kHbibWXrHf14ujJicGmulstOTKS2lmyQ5ibB8KbhNDNyEJPzRYQB2siaf0ZOgf6RGOzKhPKyKlcjdoI4AIMUibrBT9phWF9fg29hBQ4DiaQ%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  <p>《命令与征服》也能移植？</p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span data-eleid=\"3\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-eleid&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Fable 5回归不到五天，网友已经玩出花了，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">推特都快变成黑客松现场了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">有人在做游戏引擎，有人在复刻经典大作，有人在搞电影级网站，还有人直接上了计算机视觉的顶会级课题。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">今天咱们一起来看看，这五天里最有意思的几个案例。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 3 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;3 2 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253); pointer-events: initial; visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(49, 49, 49); font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; pointer-events: initial; visibility: visible; display: inline !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">\n   <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">游戏的门槛一塌再塌</span></span></p>\n  </h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">先看这个，上次我做了网页版红警，</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Google DeepMind的设计主管</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Ammaar Reshi</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">跟我想到一起去了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5625579240037072\" data-w=\"1079\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5ce270eb&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FVauqib9kHbibU1UGtABcETaBhsuMCQNk6PuL8hcTdc6PPcasfhPUD5RJM8KGk3huEh4WSACAGgg8dkPziavvTA40BKl51cibGPv0kyBtf6HyXnU%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg%26tp%3Dwebp%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%23imgIndex%3D1\"></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">他把《命令与征服：</span></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;display: inline !important;float: none;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">将军 零点时刻</span></span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">》塞进了iPhone和iPad。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(15, 20, 25); font-family: TwitterChirp, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Segoe UI\\&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">一个20多年前的C++引擎游戏，现在原生运行在手机上</span></span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，</span></span><span style=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(15, 20, 25); font-family: TwitterChirp, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Segoe UI\\&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">不到19小时内完成了19次提交。</span></span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">触屏框选、缩放、指挥作战全都能用，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">触控操作还专门为即时战略手感做了适配。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167547\" data-ratio=\"0.5633802816901409\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"568\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=b63f23ef&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FVauqib9kHbibXvkPtox2alzmpkesq9dy4N0hNxlkWtW9hIU8lvWX0THaMLgyWsmvoGMP3jEYDbpibLicvUSOOk5kUFquCTnCpLUQI0889icVWuzA%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">其中涉及的大部分代码，一个叫GeneralsX的开源项目从去年2月就开始写了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">但图形层的跨架构翻译和触控系统的重新设计，一直是卡住的。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Fable 5做的，是最后那截一直没人搞定的部分</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，让这套老代码在苹果手机上真正跑起来，能用手指玩。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167558\" data-ratio=\"0.4842592592592593\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=b5358b69&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FVauqib9kHbibXLxt41fib8e2YVfbwk03FK3uDQwsVkrf52bgvUtE7kLUh530xxQWeIhlqSniajsc2h3QpXic8xFSna8tZzMauf9Q9XjxDRBXVrv0%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">有意思的是，作者Ammaar Reshi是Google DeepMind的设计主管，有人问他：\"你都Google的人了，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">为什么不用你们自己的Gemini Pro</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">？\"&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167559\" data-ratio=\"0.225\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=d0b1ea49&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FVauqib9kHbibVyR1sZvwiayoicxBUozibCMGiaqNf7sZt3jlZicYIkafjAjliaBVqjP9BtxQ1ZG0lWSib4kfkAFSJrG8kE1GFZxp7afxRUoA4XLOjvBU%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Reshi的回应是：</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">尊重竞争对手。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">说到底，面对眼前这个任务，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Fable 5就是更好的工具。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167548\" data-ratio=\"0.7745762711864407\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1180\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a3cef08f&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FVauqib9kHbibVmfJiblxPj6oPbFmHdRCILic7rYMKAgsNuDlib30buwxkrlXwlaR7VFnZe8z4Cib52H4rIgnmqffSnj3XfVY6vNvAfHyyfl0jvt2g%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"4 2 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span data-eleid=\"3\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">还有这个，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">2500 行代码，复刻一个《部落冲突》。</span></span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">放以前，这句话听起来像在开玩笑，2500 行代码，连它的登录界面都写不完。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">但现在，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Fable 5一句话就搞定了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167546\" data-ratio=\"0.4902687673772011\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=12d4a1db&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FVauqib9kHbibX17WmEH19yCiaDOJ5pickNXZIVZ6QsmjRVEVicIs9wEL2486QCuXurEKIZwL5kOCMHC9AtBdE8Vbnu5PZw9XItRCdglVgSArHbGo%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">作者中途发现Fable想多了，还喊了句\"不用想太多，做个demo就行\"，Fable当场砍掉过度设计，顺手自己抓了《部落冲突》的美术素材，效果</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">已经有七八分像。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">再看这个更离谱的——有人让Fable做了一款的3D即时战略游戏，画风类似《帝国时代》，能建造建筑、采集资源、指挥作战，完整的3D场景。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167555\" data-ratio=\"0.6477732793522267\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"494\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=e7c396ac&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FVauqib9kHbibXGy7CibICREh89Bfq2ETichm9CwdlsjZWLssUbxC7Quj6bjGMIkgzuILjsb4E3zAfJwZ21vIJK7CV4L18yTLnc5FBKtq9mprADk%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">作者Riley Brown只给了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">4条prompt，花了173美元的token</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，Fable从零生成了整个游戏。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"图像\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167556\" data-ratio=\"0.5876865671641791\" data-w=\"1072\" data-type=\"jpeg\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=7ffc0d38&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FVauqib9kHbibV838yUsEHZbc8WBKQcdd7sbtlhRXhRw5icEa0PtRQR5UfbQTRHKphCiaVhwWxByO3wCnxamDa6rcEiblWeYZESfHDk8tkh8sC3sM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">放以前这种项目，一个小型独立团队做出来也得几个月。建模、地图编辑器、资源系统、AI逻辑、镜头控制，每一项单拎出来都不是小活。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">现在4句话说完，173美元结账走人。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">还有这个，说实话我一开始刷到这个视频的时候，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">真以为是个已上线的游戏</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">3D跑酷场景非常完整：角色在场景里奔跑、跳跃、侧滑，背景里的城市建筑向后延伸，障碍物的节奏感、镜头跟随的感觉都非常真实。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167557\" data-ratio=\"2.171875\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a96948e9&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FVauqib9kHbibWsWqNqV9Yia7bp606QGAxnLFCPHObpbT9icLRebjubpibC1AkicGDymfGTcJgec0DLXMYGrBzCYSQ6z6v09oial1KdtkwOx5fHIXh8%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span data-eleid=\"3\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25);font-family: TwitterChirp, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;